    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The purpose of [nix.dev](https://nix.dev) ([source](https://github.com/nixos/nix.dev)) is to orient beginners in the Nix ecosystem.",
      "source_hash": 6053146096141379927,
      "context_hash": 4833209324395408008,
      "translation": "[nix.dev](https://nix.dev)([소스](https://github.com/nixos/nix.dev))의 목적은 Nix 생태계에 입문하는 초보자를 안내하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nix": "Nix"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:17:23.348233Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The documentation team maintains nix.dev as editors.",
